        </p>
        
        <div class="mt-8 space-y-4 text-lg text-neutral-300 leading-relaxed">
          <p>
            Locked out late at night? Key snapped in the lock? Door won't lock and you need your property secured fast? {{name}} provides a reliable 24 hour emergency locksmith service in {{location}} for homes and businesses. We respond quickly, explain your options clearly, and aim for the safest, least disruptive solution.
