          When you need an emergency locksmith
        </h2>
        
        <div class="mt-8 text-lg text-neutral-700">
          <p>
            Call an emergency locksmith in {{location}} if:
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
      
      <div class="mt-10 max-w-3xl mx-auto">
        <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-8">
          <ul class="space-y-4 text-left list-disc marker:text-amber-500 pl-5">
            <li>You're locked out of your home or business</li>
            <li>You've accidentally locked yourself out (for example, leaving keys inside or a pet locking the door)</li>
            <li>Your key is snapped, stuck, or spinning</li>
            <li>Your lock is jammed or won't turn</li>
