            <li>Your door won't lock (especially uPVC multipoint doors)</li>
            <li>You've had a break-in or attempted burglary</li>
            <li>You've lost your keys and need locks changed urgently</li>
            <li>A lock failure leaves you insecure overnight</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        
        <div class="mt-12 max-w-4xl mx-auto text-center">
          <div class="p-6 bg-amber-50 border border-amber-200 rounded-2xl">
            <p class="text-neutral-800">
              If you are locked out, check for spare keys with family members or your landlord before calling a locksmith.
            </p>
            <p class="mt-4 text-neutral-800">
              Attempting DIY forced entry can cause significant damage and may void your home insurance.
            </p>
            <p class="mt-4 font-semibold text-neutral-900">
              If anyone is in immediate danger, contact emergency services first.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Benefits of emergency locksmiths -->
  <section class="bg-neutral-50 py-24">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6">
      <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto text-center">
        <h2 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-neutral-900">
          Benefits of emergency locksmiths
        </h2>
        
        <div class="mt-10 space-y-6 text-lg text-neutral-700 text-left">
          <p>
            Emergency locksmith services offer crucial support when you need urgent help with a locked door, broken lock, or lost keys. One of the biggest benefits is the rapid response— Our locksmiths are available 24 hours a day, ensuring you're never left stranded, whether it's the early hours or during a busy workday. This is especially valuable for commercial customers, where a lock issue can disrupt business operations and compromise security.
          </p>
          <p>
            By choosing a fully qualified locksmith, you gain access to professional service and expert advice on the best solutions for your situation. Emergency locksmiths can quickly help you gain access to your property, repair or replace locks, and even recommend lock upgrades to high security locks for added peace of mind. Our 24 hour emergency availability means you can rely on us for urgent help, knowing your locks and property are in safe hands.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Emergency locksmith services in [location] -->


  <!-- Locked out? We aim for non-destructive entry -->
  <section class="bg-neutral-50 py-24">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6">
      <div class="grid lg:grid-cols-2 gap-12 items-center">
        <div>
          <h2 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-neutral-900">
            Locked out? We aim for non-destructive entry
          </h2>
          
