        <h2 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-neutral-900">
          Break-in or attempted burglary? Secure your property fast
        </h2>
        
        <div class="mt-8 text-lg text-neutral-700">
          <p>
            After a burglary attempt, speed matters. We can:
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
      
      <div class="mt-10 max-w-3xl mx-auto">
        <div class="space-y-4 text-left">
          <div class="flex items-start gap-3">
            <span class="text-amber-500 text-2xl mt-1">1.</span>
            <div>
              <span class="font-medium text-neutral-900">Repair or replace damaged locks</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="flex items-start gap-3">
            <span class="text-amber-500 text-2xl mt-1">2.</span>
            <div>
              <span class="font-medium text-neutral-900">Reinstate safe access and improve security</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="flex items-start gap-3">
