            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- uPVC door won't lock? Common emergency call-out -->
  <section class="bg-neutral-50 py-24">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6">
      <div class="grid lg:grid-cols-2 gap-12 items-center">
        <div>
          <h2 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-neutral-900">
            uPVC door won't lock? Common emergency call-out
          </h2>
          
          <div class="mt-8 space-y-6 text-lg text-neutral-700">
            <p>
              Many emergency calls involve uPVC doors that suddenly won't lock/unlock. This is often caused by:
            </p>
