  <!-- Lock repairs and maintenance -->
  <section class="py-24 bg-white">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6">
      <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto text-center">
        <h2 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-neutral-900">
          Lock repairs and maintenance
        </h2>
        
        <div class="mt-10 space-y-6 text-lg text-neutral-700 text-left">
          <p>
            Regular lock repairs and maintenance are essential for keeping all the locking points on your doors secure and functioning smoothly. Faulty locks, jammed locks, or damaged or faulty locks can leave your property vulnerable and increase the risk of lock snapping or break-ins. Emergency locksmith services can address these issues promptly, repairing or replacing all the locks as needed—including mortice locks and anti snap locks—to restore your security.
          </p>
          <p>
            Professional locksmiths not only fix immediate problems but also offer guidance on maintaining your locks and keys to prevent future issues. By staying proactive with lock maintenance, you can avoid the inconvenience and risk of emergency situations, ensuring that all the locking points on your doors remain reliable and secure.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Lock snapping prevention -->
  <section class="bg-gradient-to-r from-neutral-900 to-neutral-800 text-white py-24">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6">
      <div class="grid lg:grid-cols-2 gap-12 items-center">
