            </p>
            <p>
              Emergency locksmiths can assess your current locking systems and recommend the best security devices, including thumb turn locks and other advanced options, to prevent lock snapping. They can also carry out upvc door repairs and install new locks to strengthen your property's defences. By taking these steps, you reduce the risk of burglary and ensure that your doors and all the locks provide the highest level of security for your home or business.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
        
        <div class="relative">
          <div class="relative rounded-3xl overflow-hidden shadow-2xl">
            <Image 
              src={lock} 
              alt="Lock snapping prevention and security upgrades"
              class="w-full h-[400px] object-cover" width={800} height={400} loading="lazy" />
